[I] Script for periodic renewal of certificates using BSD's acme-client

[T] acme-client-plus provides a ready-to-go POSIX shell script for periodic
[T] renewal of TLS certificates with the BSD acme-client. It reads a simple
[T] configuration file listing domains and handles key generation and
[T] renewal.

[U] https://github.com/jirutka/acme-client-plus

[A] Acme-client-plus Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

